    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_1X34YGdTiaOe2G2",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID40",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Qeb36ba85a34172b0-chunk_93cd474ca73aee9e9a6ff841",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>EDOS Label</strong></p><p><strong>1.2 incitement and encouragement of harm</strong> – Inciting or encouraging an individual, group, or general audience to harm a woman or group of women. It includes language where the author seeks to rationalise and/or justify harming women to another person.</p><br><p><strong>Paragraph</strong></p>4. Towards common definitions of cyber violence against women and girls &gt; Proposed definition<br><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">attacks perpetrated against more vulnerable groups of women and girls (including journal- ists, politicians, activists, LGBTIQ+, etc.) are detected and more insights are gained into the phenomenon.\n\nOnline gender-based hate speech is defined as content posted and shared through ICT means that:\n\nis hateful towards women and/or girls because of their gender, or because of a combination of gender and other factors (e.g. race, age, disability, sexuality, ethnicity, nationality, religion or profession); and/or\n\nspreads, incites, promotes or justifies hatred based on gender, or because of a combi- nation of gender and other factors (e.g. race, age, disability, sexuality, ethnicity, nationality, religion or profession).\n\nIt can also involve posting and sharing, through ICT means, violent content that consists of portraying women and girls as sexual objects or targets of violence. This content can be sent privately or publicly and is often targeted at women in public-facing roles.\n\nThe acts can:\n\na. start online and continue offline;\n\nb. start offline and continue online;\n\nc. can be perpetrated by an unknown person / group of people who are unknown to the victim; or\n\nd. can be perpetrated by a person or/ group of people who are known to the victim.</div><br>",
        "DataExportTag": "Qeb36ba85a34172b0-chunk_93cd474ca73aee9e9a6ff841",
        "QuestionType": "MC",
        "Selector": "SAVR",
        "SubSelector": "TX",
